  "summary": "Senior Software Development Engineer with 25+ years building cloud-scale architecture and high-performance systems. I drive innovation from platform-level design to low-level optimization, delivering large-scale technical initiatives that matter.\n\nCore Expertise: System Architecture • Cloud Infrastructure • Security Engineering • Database Design • AI/ML Systems\n\nTechnical Stack:\n\n- AI & Machine Learning: LLM-based autonomous agents, LangGraph, LangChain, MLflow, RAG, CrewAI, Strands, AgentCore, Bedrock, MCP, A2A\n\n- Cloud & Infrastructure: AWS (KeyMaster, ECS, Lambda, S3, EC2), CI/CD pipelines, Infrastructure as Code\n\n- Programming Languages\n  - Modern: Python, TypeScript, Java\n  - Systems: C/C++ (Win32, MFC, ATL, ActiveX, BHO)\n  - Mobile: Swift, Objective-C, Java (Android)\n  - Scripting: Groovy, Perl, PHP, JavaScript\n\n- Databases\n  - SQL: MSSQL, MySQL, PostgreSQL\n  - NoSQL: MongoDB, DynamoDB, Neptune, DocumentDB\n  - Vector: pgvector\n\n- Security & Cryptography: PKI, OpenSSL, SGX C++ enclave, AWS KeyMaster, AES, DES, RC4, MD5\n\n- Mobile & Virtualization\n  - Android: Dalvik, ART, OBB, emulators\n  - iOS: Objective-C, Swift\n  - Virtualization: Cloudpaging, Corellium, ECS-based browser automation\n\n- DevOps & Deployment\n  - Windows: MSI, WIX, InstallShield, InTune, SCCM, GPO, MSIX\n  - CI/CD: Automated pipelines, infrastructure automation\n  - Containers: Docker, ECS\n\n- Standards & Methodologies: IEEE 1471, ISO 9126, CMMI, Design Patterns (Factory, Proxy, Observer, Singleton, Strategy)\n\n- Platforms: Windows, Linux, macOS, Android, ChromeOS",
